+# ---- 4c. fma implies vex: the explicit -mfma target classes ---------------
+# FMA3 exists only in the VEX encoding (no legacy-SSE FMA), so an explicit
+# -mfma implies the -mavx chain exactly like GCC (oracle, gcc 14.2
